          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Creator Toolkit</span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mt-1">More Utilities for Creators & Marketers</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 not-prose">
          <a href="/tiktok-bio-checker" class="p-5 bg-surface-card hover:bg-surface-strong rounded-xl border border-hairline transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between space-y-2">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">🎵 TikTok Bio Checker & Counter</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1 leading-relaxed">Count characters against the strict 80-char limit with live profile preview.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-primary inline-flex items-center gap-1">Check TikTok Bio &rarr;</span>
          </a>

          <a href="/roi-calculator" class="p-5 bg-surface-card hover:bg-surface-strong rounded-xl border border-hairline transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between space-y-2">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">📊 ROI & CAGR Calculator</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1 leading-relaxed">Calculate Return on Investment, Marketing ROI, and annual compound growth rates.</p>
